WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.940 --> 00:00:17.681
The Carters visited Grandpa.

2
00:00:17.682 --> 00:00:21.733
"I am so glad to see you!" he said.

3
00:00:21.734 --> 00:00:27.481
"We will have lots of fun!"

4
00:00:27.482 --> 00:00:31.557
Grandpa took the kids to the park.

5
00:00:31.558 --> 00:00:37.215
"Let's ride the go-karts!" Grandpa said.

6
00:00:37.216 --> 00:00:43.127
"Cool!" Harry said.

7
00:00:43.128 --> 00:00:48.723
Grandpa drove his go-kart fast.

8
00:00:48.724 --> 00:00:51.958
"Be careful!" Harry said.

9
00:00:51.959 --> 00:00:59.949
"Go-karts can be dangerous!"

10
00:00:59.950 --> 00:01:04.266
"Let's go roller-skating!" Grandpa said.

11
00:01:04.267 --> 00:01:11.916
"I'll race you!"

12
00:01:11.917 --> 00:01:15.671
They skated fast.

13
00:01:15.672 --> 00:01:20.211
Grandpa almost fell down.

14
00:01:20.212 --> 00:01:25.726
"Be careful!" Emmy said.

15
00:01:25.727 --> 00:01:33.652
"Maybe we should do something else now."

16
00:01:33.653 --> 00:01:37.760
"Let's go on the slide!" Grandpa said.

17
00:01:37.761 --> 00:01:43.708
"That is a very tall slide," Oliver said.

18
00:01:43.709 --> 00:01:49.424
Grandpa said, "Come on!"

19
00:01:49.425 --> 00:01:52.488
Grandpa slid down headfirst.

20
00:01:52.489 --> 00:02:00.442
"Be careful!" Oliver said.

21
00:02:00.443 --> 00:02:04.495
"You could get hurt!"

22
00:02:04.496 --> 00:02:07.803
Grandpa looked sad.

23
00:02:07.804 --> 00:02:11.631
"I didn't mean to scare you," he said.

24
00:02:11.632 --> 00:02:15.139
"I just wanted to have fun.

25
00:02:15.140 --> 00:02:18.938
I want to be the best grandpa ever."

26
00:02:18.939 --> 00:02:23.502
Emmy hugged Grandpa.

27
00:02:23.503 --> 00:02:29.635
"You are the best grandpa ever!" she said.

28
00:02:29.636 --> 00:02:33.397
"We can have fun," Harry said.

29
00:02:33.398 --> 00:02:37.377
"Lots of fun things are not dangerous.

30
00:02:37.378 --> 00:02:40.685
Let's do safe, fun things!"

31
00:02:40.686 --> 00:02:44.735
"Okay." Grandpa thought hard.

32
00:02:44.736 --> 00:02:49.262
Then he pointed up to the sky.

33
00:02:49.263 --> 00:02:51.802
"Let's go skydiving!"

34
00:02:51.803 --> 00:02:56.546
The kids gasped.

35
00:02:56.547 --> 00:03:01.057
"Skydiving is not safe!" Harry said.

36
00:03:01.058 --> 00:03:05.201
Grandpa laughed hard.

37
00:03:05.202 --> 00:03:08.633
"Just kidding!" he said.

38
00:03:08.634 --> 00:03:18.999
"Who wants to get some ice cream?"
